ull/8348.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T04:35:11Z"},"body":"Internal bug: b/416260484\r\n\r\nThe `lastReportedAt` field is uninitialized during reporter construction, defaulting to the `Zero` timestamp. This results in an excessively large `LoadReportInterval` (calculated as Now() - lastReportedAt) for the initial load report. Initializing `lastReportedAt` to Now() during construction will ensure the `LoadReportInterval` is accurately approximated for the first report.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES:\r\n- xdsclient: fix unexpectedly large LoadReportInterval in initial load report request.","closed_by":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}